{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.math.BigInteger;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final long MOD2 = 998244353L;\n    static final long MOD1 = 1000000007L;\n    static BufferedReader in;\n    static PrintWriter out;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        out = new PrintWriter(System.out);\n        long[] input = Arrays.stream(in.readLine().split(\" \")).mapToLong(Long::parseLong).toArray();\n        long n = input[0], m = input[1], l = input[2], r = input[3];\n        long d = r - l + 1;\n        long a = d >>> 1;\n        long b = d - a;\n        long nm = n * m;\n        long mod = MOD2;\n\n        long s1 = modSum(a + b, nm, mod);\n        long s2 = modSum(Math.abs(a - b), nm, mod);\n        long ans = modSum(s1, s2, mod);\n        ans = mulMod(ans, modInverse(BigInteger.valueOf(2), BigInteger.valueOf(mod)).longValue(), mod);\n\n        if ((nm & 1L) == 1L) {\n            ans = modPow(d, nm, mod);\n        }\n\n        out.println(ans);\n        out.flush();\n        out.close();\n    }\n\n    static long modSum(long x, long y, long mod) {\n        return ((x % mod) + (y % mod)) % mod;\n    }\n\n    static long mulMod(long a, long b, long mod) {\n        return (a % mod) * (b % mod) % mod;\n    }\n\n    static long modPow(long base, long exp, long mod) {\n        return BigInteger.valueOf(base).modPow(BigInteger.valueOf(exp), BigInteger.valueOf(mod)).longValue();\n    }\n\n    static long modInverse(long a, long mod) {\n        return BigInteger.valueOf(a).modInverse(BigInteger.valueOf(mod)).longValue();\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <cctype>\n#include <iomanip>\n#include <map>\n#include <set>\n#include <stack>\n#include <queue>\n#include <deque>\n#include <climits>\n#include <cstdint>\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst long long MOD2 = 998244353LL;\nconst long long MOD1 = 1000000007LL;\n\nlong long modSum(long long x, long long y, long long mod) {\n    x %= mod;\n    y %= mod;\n    return ((x + y) % mod + mod) % mod;\n}\n\nlong long mulMod(long long a, long long b, long long mod) {\n    a %= mod;\n    b %= mod;\n    return (a * b) % mod;\n}\n\nlong long modPow(long long base, long long exp, long long mod) {\n    base %= mod;\n    long long result = 1;\n    while (exp > 0) {\n        if (exp & 1) {\n            result = (result * base) % mod;\n        }\n        base = (base * base) % mod;\n        exp >>= 1;\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n\nlong long modInverse(long long a, long long mod) {\n    long long m0 = mod, y = 0, x = 1;\n    if (mod == 1) return 0;\n    while (a > 1) {\n        long long q = a / mod;\n        long long t = mod;\n        mod = a % mod;\n        a = t;\n        t = y;\n        y = x - q * y;\n        x = t;\n    }\n    if (x < 0) x += m0;\n    return x;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    string line;\n    getline(cin, line);\n    istringstream iss(line);\n    vector<long long> input;\n    string token;\n    while (iss >> token) {\n        input.push_back(stoll(token));\n    }\n    \n    long long n = input[0], m = input[1], l = input[2], r = input[3];\n    long long d = r - l + 1;\n    long long a = d >> 1;\n    long long b = d - a;\n    long long nm = n * m;\n    long long mod = MOD2;\n\n    long long s1 = modSum(a + b, nm, mod);\n    long long s2 = modSum(llabs(a - b), nm, mod);\n    long long ans = modSum(s1, s2, mod);\n    ans = mulMod(ans, modInverse(2, mod), mod);\n\n    if ((nm & 1LL) == 1LL) {\n        ans = modPow(d, nm, mod);\n    }\n\n    cout << ans << endl;\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00018892886873800308, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.00025567124248482287, -5.960462772236497e-07, -3.3378546504536644e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.0847986231965479e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -0.45542800426483154, -5.2927523938706145e-05, -3.933898824470816e-06, -4.6491513785440475e-06, -0.3898998498916626, -9.536738616588991e-07, -2.861018856492592e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.37761324644088745, -7.152531907195225e-06, -0.00018034738604910672, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.38352036476135254, -0.0004894727608188987, -0.003602920565754175, -4.291525328881107e-06, -0.2695772647857666, -0.009756498970091343, -0.0076107303611934185, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -0.6049947142601013, -0.0004365683125797659, -0.004079473204910755, -0.006734768394380808, -3.3378546504536644e-06, -0.5960664749145508, -0.04859050735831261, -0.01604572683572769, -4.172316494077677e-06, -0.8511412739753723, -0.0002613918040879071, -0.00016044282529037446, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -0.0027707540430128574, -2.7894584491150454e-05, -2.2649508537142538e-05, -1.6569954823353328e-05, -0.02919529378414154, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.0490362910786644e-05, -1.31130127